{"id":"sagrado","lemma":"sagrado","pos":"adj","rank":2157,"glosses":["holy, sacred"],"ipa":"/saˈɡɾa.du/","forms":{"feminine":"sagrada","masculinePlural":"sagrados","femininePlural":"sagradas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6b/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Wiktionairy-sagrado.wav","examples":[{"text":"Algumas coisa são sagradas.","en":"Some things are sacred.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1268329","words":[{"g":"some, any","l":"algum"},{"g":"thing"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"A vida humana é sagrada.","en":"Human life is sacred.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/889209","words":[{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"state of being alive"},{"g":"human","l":"humano"},{"g":"is","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"Na Índia, a vaca é animal sagrado.","en":"In India, cows are sacred animals.","words":[{"g":"in the"},{"g":"Indian","l":"índio"},{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"a cow"},{"g":"is","l":"ser"},{"g":"animal"},null]},{"text":"Na Índia, as vacas são animais sagrados.","en":"In India, cows are sacred animals.","words":[{"g":"in the"},{"g":"Indian","l":"índio"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"a cow","l":"vaca"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"animal","l":"animal"},null]},{"text":"As vacas são sagradas para os hindus.","en":"Cows are sacred to Hindus.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"a cow","l":"vaca"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"for / to"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"Hindu","l":"hindu"}]}]}